[01:20.07]बाजन दे तू, बाजन दे तू,
[01:24.87]ढोल नगाड़े बाज़न दे तू!
[01:34.48]Let the bump fly, bawle!
[01:39.28]Let the bump fly, bawle!
[01:44.09]I’m getting high, bawle!
[01:48.89]I’m getting high, bawle!
[01:53.70]... 3, 2, 1... GO!
